	<strings name="main_menu/settings_select/player_setup/player_profile_edit/vr_setup/help_strings">
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="What aims: the right controller, which holds the\nweapon, your head, or a gamepad's right stick."/>
		<string text="With a gamepad, the right stick turns and\npitches the view, only turns it, or in steps."/>
		<string text="The refresh rate, resolution and foveation, the late\nlatch, and where the menus are."/>
		<string text="The HUD: visor, wrist or hidden; its size, its\ndepth, the visor's look and where its corners are."/>
		<string text="Left-handed? Your hand, your height, seated or\nstanding, the world's scale, recentring."/>
		<string text="Turning, the comfort vignette, sprinting, parkour,\nbullet time, the third person and the vehicles' view."/>
		<string text="The hands, two-handed aim, holsters, reloading,\ngrenades, melee, fists and pulling a weapon to you."/>
	</strings>
